cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."

title: "Geographic Body Heat Storage (BHS) Model"

authors:
  - family-names: "Chambers"
    given-names: "Samuel N."

version: "1.0.0"

doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23816752"

url: "https://github.com/spatiosam/bhs-model"

date-released: 2026-09-30
license: MIT
keywords:
  - biometeorology
  - body heat storage
  - heat balance
  - core temperature
  - GIS
  - raster
  - thermal physiology
abstract: >-
  A minimal R/terra implementation of a spatially explicit human body
  heat-storage model that accepts user-supplied climate rasters and can
  return body heat storage in watts, estimated temperature change per hour,
  and estimated temperature change per meter walked.
